{"id":"9e4fb9751cf37385","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-prop-intersection-definition.md","title":"Intersection Definition","display":"prop-intersection-definition — Intersection Definition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-intersection-definition","aliases":["58-prop-intersection-definition"],"display":"prop-intersection-definition — Intersection Definition","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-set-family.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-intersection.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-intersection-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-intersection-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-intersection-definition — Intersection Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"852a6bf29c9fad95\" href=\"?note=852a6bf29c9fad95\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-set-family.md\">../batch10/58-df-set-family.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fde8356a8733e94f\" href=\"?note=fde8356a8733e94f\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-intersection.md\">../batch06/58-df-intersection.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span> (nonempty set family, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"852a6bf29c9fad95\" href=\"?note=852a6bf29c9fad95\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-set-family.md\">../batch10/58-df-set-family.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal F\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal F\\neq\\varnothing\n\\to\n\\forall x\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in\\bigcap\\mathcal F\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(x\\in A)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal F\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal F\\neq\\varnothing\n\\to\n\\forall x\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in\\bigcap\\mathcal F\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(x\\in A)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The intersection of a family is the set of elements belonging to all members.</li>\n<li>In ZFC there is no universal set, so the absolute intersection of the empty family has no canonical set value. A relative intersection may instead be taken inside a specified ambient set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-set-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"852a6bf29c9fad95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-set-family.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-intersection.md","status":"resolved","id":"fde8356a8733e94f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-intersection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-set-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"852a6bf29c9fad95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F\\in V$ (nonempty set family, see [[../batch10/58-df-set-family.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal F\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal F\\neq\\varnothing\n\\to\n\\forall x\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in\\bigcap\\mathcal F\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(x\\in A)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1037,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3967","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-prop-intersection-definition.md|58-prop-intersection-definition]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["852a6bf29c9fad95","fde8356a8733e94f"]}